{size200}{red}{bold1}REGISTERED COMPUTER NOT RECOGNIZED
{size0}
{black}This message occurs upon two cases:
{bold0}{offset150}
{bold1}1 -{bold0} You changed your computer or upgraded it. In this case click {blueink}Transfer license{black} to register this computer as the new REGISTERED COMPUTER.

{bold1}2 -{bold0} You copied this game on an other computer while it is still installed on the REGISTERED COMPUTER. This is forbidden by law. In this case click {blueink}Purchase new license{black} to obtain a new license for this computer or remove the game.

{red}{bold1}WARNING:{bold0}{black} Violating the LICENSE AGREEMENT results in the immediate suspension of the license and attached services. {red}Software duplication is a theft punished by international laws to sentences going up to $50,000 fine and 3 months in prison{black}
